## `srccs/` — C# / .NET implementation

### Consumer — [`srccs/MqConsumer/`](srccs/MqConsumer/)

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| [`MqConsumer.csproj`](srccs/MqConsumer/MqConsumer.csproj) | .NET 8 project, pulls `IBMXMSDotnetClient` from NuGet |
| [`AppConfig.cs`](srccs/MqConsumer/AppConfig.cs) | Loads & validates `consumer.properties` — typed properties, parses `consumer.threads`, converts `consumer.timeoutSeconds` → ms |
| [`Log4jStyleFormatter.cs`](srccs/MqConsumer/Log4jStyleFormatter.cs) | Static formatter: `yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss,fff LEVEL [threadId] loggerName - message` |
| [`LoggingSetup.cs`](srccs/MqConsumer/LoggingSetup.cs) | `AppLogger` — thread-safe, single-file, append-mode writer; `AppLogger.Init()` + `AppLogger.GetLogger()` |
| [`ConsumerWorker.cs`](srccs/MqConsumer/ConsumerWorker.cs) | `Run()` on its own thread — creates XMS connection via `XMSFactoryFactory` + CCDT, receive loop until timeout, logs destination/replyTo/body, closes quietly in `finally` |
| [`Program.cs`](srccs/MqConsumer/Program.cs) | Loads config, inits logging, spawns `N` `worker-n` threads, joins all, logs exit |

### Producer — [`srccs/MqProducer/`](srccs/MqProducer/)

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| [`MqProducer.csproj`](srccs/MqProducer/MqProducer.csproj) | .NET 8 project, `IBMXMSDotnetClient` NuGet |
| [`ProducerConfig.cs`](srccs/MqProducer/ProducerConfig.cs) | Loads `producer.properties` — adds `MessagesPerThread` |
| [`Log4jStyleFormatter.cs`](srccs/MqProducer/Log4jStyleFormatter.cs) | Identical formatter, independent copy in `MqProducer` namespace |
| [`LoggingSetup.cs`](srccs/MqProducer/LoggingSetup.cs) | Same `AppLogger` pattern, independent copy |
| [`ProducerWorker.cs`](srccs/MqProducer/ProducerWorker.cs) | `Run()` — creates XMS connection, sends `messagesPerThread` `TextMessage` objects with body `destination=X threadId=Y msg=Z`, logs each send, closes in `finally` |
| [`Program.cs`](srccs/MqProducer/Program.cs) | Loads config, inits logging, spawns `N` `producer-n` threads, joins all, logs total messages sent |

### Key translation choices (Java → C#)

- **JMS → XMS**: `jakarta.jms.*` maps to `IBM.XMS`; `MQConnectionFactory` is replaced by `XMSFactoryFactory.GetInstance(XMSC.CT_WMQ)` + `XMSC.WMQ_CCDTURL` / `XMSC.WMQ_QUEUE_MANAGER`
- **`java.util.logging`** → `AppLogger` (thin wrapper with the same log4j-style format; `FileHandler` thread-safety replaced by `lock`)
- **`Thread.currentThread().getId()`** → `Thread.CurrentThread.ManagedThreadId`
- **`java.util.Properties`** → manual `.properties` parser (same comment/blank-line handling)
- Build instructions added to [`BUILDING.md`](BUILDING.md) with `dotnet restore/build/run/publish` commands

